WEBVTT

00:07.793 --> 00:09.034
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.103 --> 00:10.827
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.896 --> 00:12.206
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.275 --> 00:14.310
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.379 --> 00:17.275
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.344 --> 00:19.379
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.448 --> 00:21.379
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.448 --> 00:23.275
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.344 --> 00:24.965
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.034 --> 00:27.413
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.482 --> 00:29.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.275 --> 00:31.344
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.413 --> 00:33.379
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.448 --> 00:35.241
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.310 --> 00:37.379
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.448 --> 00:39.482
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.551 --> 00:40.827
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.896 --> 00:42.689
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.758 --> 00:45.241
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.310 --> 00:47.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.793 --> 00:49.379
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.068 --> 00:53.896
[goofy music]
[愚蠢的音乐]

00:53.965 --> 01:00.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.034 --> 01:02.379
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

01:02.448 --> 01:04.103
- Attention, shoppers:
- 购物者请注意：

01:04.172 --> 01:07.000
We've got a SpongeBob
on Aisle 6.
我们有海绵宝宝
在 6 号过道上。

01:07.068 --> 01:08.379
[all screaming, shouting]
[所有人尖叫，喊叫]

01:08.448 --> 01:10.206
[both screaming]
- Make a sharp left!
[两人尖叫]
- 向左急转！

01:10.275 --> 01:13.172
[both babbling]
[两人都胡言乱语]

01:13.241 --> 01:15.620
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

01:15.689 --> 01:16.827
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

01:16.896 --> 01:20.034
- We're here!
- [straining]
- 我们到了！
- [紧张]

01:20.103 --> 01:21.793
I still don't understand
why you had me wear
我还是不明白
你为什么让我穿

01:21.862 --> 01:25.068
a blindfold.
- Oh, um, I didn't want you
一个眼罩。
- 哦，嗯，我不想要你

01:25.137 --> 01:27.724
to get anything
in your eyes.
得到任何东西
在你眼里。

01:27.793 --> 01:29.137
See?
看？

01:29.206 --> 01:31.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:31.137 --> 01:33.551
[babbling]
[胡说]

01:33.620 --> 01:36.103
- [exclaims, laughs]
- [惊呼，大笑]

01:36.172 --> 01:37.758
[impish music]
[顽皮的音乐]

01:37.827 --> 01:39.275
- Okay, thanks, buddy.
- 好的，谢谢，伙计。

01:39.344 --> 01:41.862
I'm going
to my club meeting now.
我要去
现在参加我的俱乐部会议。

01:41.931 --> 01:44.310
- What's your club, hmm?
[giggles]
- 你的俱乐部是什么，嗯？
[咯咯笑]

01:44.379 --> 01:48.000
- Uh, it's the
Empty Head Society.
- 呃，这是
空头协会。

01:48.068 --> 01:51.137
Eh, it's a place
where guys like me
呃，是一个地方
像我这样的人在哪里

01:51.206 --> 01:54.965
can give their
"powerful intellects"
可以给他们的
“强大的智力”

01:55.034 --> 01:58.000
a much-needed rest.
- Whoa!
急需的休息。
- 哇！

01:58.068 --> 01:59.344
I'd love to rest my intellect.
我很想让我的智力得到休息。

01:59.413 --> 02:01.137
Can I join?
- Sure!
我可以加入吗？
- 当然！

02:01.206 --> 02:02.827
Anyone can join.
任何人都可以加入。

02:02.896 --> 02:04.965
It's exclusive.
这是独一无二的。

02:05.034 --> 02:06.689
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

02:06.758 --> 02:08.586
[straining]
- Oh, that's not how
[紧张]
-哦，不是这样的

02:08.655 --> 02:09.586
you open it.
你打开它。

02:09.655 --> 02:11.137
You have to step on
你必须踩

02:11.206 --> 02:13.586
the automatic doormat.
自动门垫。

02:13.655 --> 02:15.413
- Hmm.
- 唔。

02:15.482 --> 02:17.482
- Ding!
- 叮！

02:17.551 --> 02:19.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:19.448 --> 02:21.344
[goofy exclamation]
[愚蠢的感叹]

02:21.413 --> 02:22.482
- Oh!
- 哦！

02:22.551 --> 02:25.310
[all babbling]
[全是胡言乱语]

02:25.379 --> 02:30.034
[goofy music]
[愚蠢的音乐]

02:30.103 --> 02:31.758
- [goofy laughter]
- [傻笑]

02:31.827 --> 02:33.068
- Wow.
- 哇。

02:33.137 --> 02:35.275
They do seem
blissfully brainless.
他们确实看起来
幸福无脑。

02:35.344 --> 02:37.344
[exclaiming]
- Oh, oh, hold it!
[惊呼]
-哦，哦，坚持住！

02:37.413 --> 02:39.482
You have to check
your smart thingy
你必须检查
你聪明的东西

02:39.551 --> 02:40.965
at the door.
在门口。

02:41.034 --> 02:42.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:42.448 --> 02:43.965
- [clucking]
- [咯咯笑]

02:44.034 --> 02:46.517
[babbling]
[胡说]

02:46.586 --> 02:47.620
- Ah!
- 啊！

02:47.689 --> 02:49.482
[straining]
[紧张]

02:49.551 --> 02:52.689
[goofy babbling]
[胡言乱语]

02:52.758 --> 02:56.000
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:56.068 --> 02:57.310
- Ugh.
- 呃。

02:57.379 --> 02:59.275
[both babbling]
[两人都胡言乱语]

02:59.344 --> 03:01.655
- Hello, numbskull.
- Hiya, dodo!
- 你好，笨蛋。
- 嗨，渡渡鸟！

03:01.724 --> 03:03.793
- Shall we do
the Empty Head handshake?
-我们可以吗
空头握手？

03:03.862 --> 03:05.758
- Okay!
- 好的！

03:05.827 --> 03:07.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:07.172 --> 03:10.103
[both babbling]
[两人都胡言乱语]

03:10.172 --> 03:14.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:14.172 --> 03:15.517
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

03:15.586 --> 03:17.310
- [screams]
What was that?
- [尖叫]
那是什么？

03:17.379 --> 03:19.206
- The signal
for the meeting to start.
- 信号
会议开始。

03:19.275 --> 03:22.344
Come on.
[all chattering]
快点。
[大家都在喋喋不休]

03:22.413 --> 03:24.862
[both babbling]
[两人都胡言乱语]

03:24.931 --> 03:26.758
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

03:26.827 --> 03:28.931
[all babbling]
[全是胡言乱语]

03:29.000 --> 03:30.137
- [hollering]
- [喊叫]

03:30.206 --> 03:32.137
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

03:32.206 --> 03:33.275
[all grunt]
[全都咕哝]

03:33.344 --> 03:35.310
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

03:35.379 --> 03:39.206
[triumphant fanfare]
[凯旋的号角]

03:39.275 --> 03:41.827
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

03:41.896 --> 03:43.310
[microphone feedback]
[麦克风反馈]

03:43.379 --> 03:46.586
Good, I see everyone's
in their assigned places.
好的，我看到大家了
在他们指定的地方。

03:46.655 --> 03:49.827
The Secretary
will now read the minutes.
秘书
现在将宣读会议纪要。

03:49.896 --> 03:51.034
- These are the minutes.
- 这些是会议记录。

03:51.103 --> 03:53.655
One minute, twelve minutes,
一分钟，十二分钟，

03:53.724 --> 03:56.448
wait a minute,
give me a minute.
等一下，
给我一分钟。

03:56.517 --> 03:58.655
- Hike!
[grunts]
- 远足！
[咕哝]

03:58.724 --> 04:01.655
Are there any new initiates
here tonight?
有没有新的入门者
今晚在这里吗？

04:01.724 --> 04:04.103
- [whispering]
SpongeBob, go up.
- [低语]
海绵宝宝，上去吧。

04:04.172 --> 04:06.482
You always wanted
to join the club.
你一直想要
加入俱乐部。

04:06.551 --> 04:07.793
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

04:07.862 --> 04:09.551
[babbles, laughs]
[胡言乱语，大笑]

04:09.620 --> 04:12.724
- Hmm, are you sure
you're, uh, brainless enough?
- 嗯，你确定吗
你够没脑子吧？

04:12.793 --> 04:15.689
- Hmm.
[shouts]
- 唔。
[喊叫]

04:15.758 --> 04:16.724
- Perfect!
- 完美的！

04:16.793 --> 04:18.620
You've earned your first badge.
您已经赢得了第一枚徽章。

04:18.689 --> 04:20.965
- [laughs weakly]
- [虚弱地笑]

04:21.034 --> 04:24.551
- It's time to pass the jar.
- 是时候传递罐子了。

04:24.620 --> 04:26.586
- Hmm?
- 唔？

04:26.655 --> 04:29.034
- [babbling]
Mm!
- [胡言乱语]
嗯！

04:29.103 --> 04:32.034
- [gargling]
- [漱口]

04:32.103 --> 04:33.827
- [retches]
- [干呕]

04:33.896 --> 04:35.034
[crowd groans]
[人群呻吟]

04:35.103 --> 04:37.241
- Hmm?
Uh...
- 唔？
呃...

04:37.310 --> 04:39.655
all: Drink! Drink! Drink!
全体：喝！喝！喝！

04:39.724 --> 04:41.206
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

04:41.275 --> 04:43.551
[whining]
[抱怨]

04:43.620 --> 04:45.965
all: Drink! Drink! Drink!
全体：喝！喝！喝！

04:46.034 --> 04:49.103
[gagging]
[作呕]

04:49.172 --> 04:50.241
[belches]
[打嗝]

04:50.310 --> 04:52.068
[all groan]
[全都呻吟]

04:52.137 --> 04:53.344
- Ugh!
- What?
- 呃！
- 什么？

04:53.413 --> 04:55.965
You said drink!
- Ahem.
你说喝！
- 咳咳。

04:56.034 --> 04:57.896
Lemonade?
- Huh?
柠檬水？
- 啊？

04:57.965 --> 05:00.551
- We just save and date
the drool.
- 我们只是保存并日期
流口水。

05:00.620 --> 05:03.793
But that was so dopey
you earned another badge!
但那太愚蠢了
您又赢得了一枚徽章！

05:03.862 --> 05:05.931
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:06.000 --> 05:07.482
There!
- Ah!
那里！
- 啊！

05:07.551 --> 05:10.344
- It's now time for us
to go out in the community
- 现在是我们的时间了
到社区去

05:10.413 --> 05:12.103
and help the citizens...
- Ow!
并帮助公民...
- 噢！

05:12.172 --> 05:13.241
- Of Bikini Bottom
- 比基尼下装

05:13.310 --> 05:16.551
by doing our civic duty.
通过履行我们的公民义务。

05:16.620 --> 05:18.137
Whatever that means.
不管那意味着什么。

05:18.206 --> 05:20.620
- Uh, we're gonna do
some civic duty?
- 呃，我们要做
一些公民义务？

05:20.689 --> 05:23.758
- We call it the "Nitwitting."
- 我们称之为“傻子”。

05:24.448 --> 05:26.137
all: ♪ We're all unfit ♪
所有人：♪ 我们都不适合 ♪

05:26.206 --> 05:27.517
♪ We must admit ♪
♪ 我们必须承认 ♪

05:27.586 --> 05:30.034
♪ We're dumb
as a box of rocks ♪
♪ 我们是笨蛋
就像一盒石头♪

05:30.103 --> 05:32.551
♪ But time permitting
we'll be nitwitting ♪
♪ 但时间允许的话
我们会开玩笑的 ♪

05:32.620 --> 05:34.551
♪ Has anyone seen our socks? ♪
♪ 有人看到我们的袜子了吗？ ♪

05:34.620 --> 05:36.379
- To the mini boats!
- 去迷你船！

05:36.448 --> 05:38.620
both: To the mini boats!
两人：去迷你船！

05:38.689 --> 05:41.344
[Richard Wagner's
"Ride of the Valkyries plays"]
[理查德·瓦格纳的
“女武神的骑行演奏”]

05:41.413 --> 05:43.586
[all babbling]
[全是胡言乱语]

05:43.655 --> 05:45.724
- Patrick, why are we
doing this, again?
- 帕特里克，我们为什么
又做这个？

05:45.793 --> 05:48.137
- I have no idea.
- 我不知道。

05:48.206 --> 05:49.793
[horn tooting]
[喇叭声]

05:49.862 --> 05:52.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:52.965 --> 05:55.793
[all babbling]
[全是胡言乱语]

05:55.862 --> 05:57.172
[both gasp, scream]
[两人都喘气，尖叫]

05:57.241 --> 05:59.206
- [shrieks]
- [尖叫]

05:59.275 --> 06:00.724
[cart neighs]
[购物车嘶嘶声]

06:00.793 --> 06:03.000
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

06:03.068 --> 06:05.034
[all babbling]
[全是胡言乱语]

06:05.103 --> 06:07.103
[cheerful tropical music]
【欢快的热带音乐】

06:07.172 --> 06:08.448
- Hey, mister.
- 嘿，先生。

06:08.517 --> 06:10.137
You dropped your ball.
你把球掉了。

06:10.206 --> 06:12.413
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

06:12.482 --> 06:14.310
[overlapping shouting]
[重叠的喊叫]

06:14.379 --> 06:16.793
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

06:16.862 --> 06:18.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:18.103 --> 06:19.206
- Keep running.
- 继续跑。

06:19.275 --> 06:21.000
I'll pace you.
我来给你配速。

06:21.068 --> 06:22.724
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

06:22.793 --> 06:24.586
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:24.655 --> 06:27.758
- These lights could use
a smile.
- 这些灯可以使用
一个微笑。

06:27.827 --> 06:28.965
[crashing]
[崩溃]

06:29.034 --> 06:31.827
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

06:31.896 --> 06:36.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:36.482 --> 06:38.000
- [shouting]
- [喊叫]

06:38.068 --> 06:40.586
- I have a feeling
you guys are a little confused
- 我有一种感觉
你们有点困惑

06:40.655 --> 06:43.310
about what civic duty is.
关于什么是公民义务。

06:43.379 --> 06:44.965
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

06:45.034 --> 06:46.862
Uh, I don't think so!
呃，我不这么认为！

06:46.931 --> 06:49.862
"Civic duty is using
your patootie."
“公民义务正在使用
你的土豆。”

06:49.931 --> 06:51.724
[laughs, grunts]
[笑声，咕哝声]

06:51.793 --> 06:53.896
No confusion there!
[grunts]
那里没有混乱！
[咕哝]

06:53.965 --> 06:55.517
[tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

06:55.586 --> 06:58.482
[exasperated music]
[愤怒的音乐]

06:58.551 --> 07:00.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:00.551 --> 07:04.000
Why would people throw
their stinky garbage
为什么人们会扔
他们的臭垃圾

07:04.068 --> 07:06.103
in these beautiful cans?
在这些漂亮的罐子里？

07:06.172 --> 07:07.413
- Hmm?
- 唔？

07:07.482 --> 07:09.206
Maybe their pockets
were already full.
也许他们的口袋
已经满了。

07:09.275 --> 07:12.172
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

07:12.241 --> 07:13.724
"Pockets full"?
“口袋满了”？

07:13.793 --> 07:16.517
I can clearly see you're not
as brainless as us.
我可以清楚地看到你不是
和我们一样无脑。

07:16.586 --> 07:19.137
- Aww...
- I can't see anything!
- 哇...
- 我什么也看不见！

07:19.206 --> 07:21.068
[sighs]
Oh well.
[叹气]
哦，好吧。

07:21.137 --> 07:24.000
I guess I'm just not
Empty Head material.
我想我只是不
空头材料。

07:24.068 --> 07:26.827
Well, bye, buddy.
好吧，再见，伙计。

07:27.724 --> 07:30.103
- My name's "Buddy" now?
- 我现在的名字是“Buddy”？

07:30.172 --> 07:32.103
[lighthearted music]
[轻松的音乐]

07:32.172 --> 07:35.103
both chanting: Buddy! Buddy!
两人都高呼：伙计！伙伴！

07:35.172 --> 07:36.517
Buddy!
伙伴！

07:36.586 --> 07:38.310
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:38.379 --> 07:40.137
Well, that's funny.
嗯，这很有趣。

07:40.206 --> 07:41.620
I seem to be lost.
我似乎迷路了。

07:41.689 --> 07:43.206
Oh, I'll figure it out.
哦，我会想办法的。

07:43.275 --> 07:46.034
I still got some life
in the ol' brain stem.
我还有一点生命
在脑干中。

07:46.103 --> 07:47.862
[electrical zapping]
[电击]

07:47.931 --> 07:52.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:52.965 --> 07:56.000
[babbling]
[胡说]

07:58.310 --> 08:01.103
What's a brain stem?
什么是脑干？

08:01.172 --> 08:02.689
I know!
我知道！

08:02.758 --> 08:04.827
I'll just walk backwards,
and that should get me back
我只会向后走
那应该能让我回来

08:04.896 --> 08:06.551
to the beginning of the day.
到一天的开始。

08:06.620 --> 08:09.793
[speaking backwards]
[倒着说]

08:09.862 --> 08:11.137
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:11.206 --> 08:14.034
I'm even more lost-er
than I was before-er.
我更迷失了er
比我以前-呃。

08:14.103 --> 08:16.586
[gasps]
[喘气]

08:16.655 --> 08:19.275
Oh, I will direct asking--
噢，我就直接问——

08:19.344 --> 08:21.000
[grunts]
Ask directions.
[咕哝]
问路。

08:21.068 --> 08:22.379
[seal barks]
[海豹吠叫]

08:22.448 --> 08:27.137
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:27.206 --> 08:28.655
Excuse me, large lady.
对不起，大女士。

08:28.724 --> 08:31.275
I'm a widdle girl
who's misplaced herself.
我是一个小提琴女孩
谁把自己放错了地方。

08:31.344 --> 08:32.586
Can you help find me?
你能帮忙找到我吗？

08:32.655 --> 08:34.482
[lisping]
I'm pretty.
[口齿不清]
我很漂亮。

08:34.551 --> 08:35.620
- Weirdo!
- Ow!
- 怪人！
- 噢！

08:35.689 --> 08:37.103
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

08:37.172 --> 08:39.000
- Well, that didn't
come out right.
- 嗯，那没有
出来吧。

08:39.068 --> 08:42.000
[whines]
[哀鸣]

08:42.068 --> 08:43.827
[whines]
[哀鸣]

08:43.896 --> 08:45.344
[downtrodden music]
[压抑的音乐]

08:45.413 --> 08:48.344
[groaning]
[呻吟]

08:48.413 --> 08:54.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:54.896 --> 08:57.413
[babbling]
[胡说]

08:57.482 --> 09:00.206
Oh, I've forgotten how to sit.
哦，我忘记怎么坐了。

09:00.275 --> 09:02.275
- [chuckles]
Obviously not
- [轻笑]
显然不是

09:02.344 --> 09:04.206
the sharpest tool in the--
最锋利的工具——

09:04.275 --> 09:06.137
the tool thing.
工具的事情。

09:06.206 --> 09:07.517
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

09:07.586 --> 09:09.586
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

09:09.655 --> 09:11.310
[sighs]
[叹气]

09:11.379 --> 09:12.620
[gasps]
[喘气]

09:12.689 --> 09:14.931
Ooh.
- Oh, there you are!
哦。
- 哦，你来了！

09:15.000 --> 09:17.758
You forgot
your thinking thingy.
你忘了
你的思想。

09:17.827 --> 09:20.551
I wasn't sure which one
was yours, buddy.
我不确定是哪一个
是你的，伙计。

09:20.620 --> 09:23.551
- Uh, now my name's "Buddy"?
- No, duh.
- 呃，现在我的名字是“Buddy”？
- 不，呃。

09:23.620 --> 09:25.275
That's my name!
- [groans]
那是我的名字！
- [呻吟]

09:25.344 --> 09:27.344
- I think.
- 我认为。

09:27.413 --> 09:30.517
- [grunts]
No, not mine.
- [咕哝]
不，不是我的。

09:30.586 --> 09:32.344
Wrong brain.
脑子错了。

09:32.413 --> 09:33.931
[babbles]
Oh, bad brain.
[胡言乱语]
哎呀，脑子不好使。

09:34.000 --> 09:36.862
Oh, I guess I'll take
this stupid one.
哦，我想我会采取
这个蠢货。

09:36.931 --> 09:39.241
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

09:39.310 --> 09:41.206
- Hmm.
- 唔。

09:41.275 --> 09:42.620
Hmm...
唔...

09:42.689 --> 09:45.413
[growling]
- [babbling]
[咆哮]
- [胡言乱语]

09:45.482 --> 09:47.344
- Try saying "I'm ready."
- 尝试说“我准备好了”。

09:47.413 --> 09:49.172
- Slime heady!
- 史莱姆令人兴奋！

09:49.241 --> 09:51.965
Uh, dime Betty!
呃，一毛钱贝蒂！

09:52.034 --> 09:55.172
- [growling]
- [babbling]
- [咆哮]
- [胡言乱语]

09:55.241 --> 09:57.310
[grunts]
Spaghetti!
[咕哝]
意大利面！

09:57.379 --> 09:58.689
I'm sweaty!
我满头大汗了！

09:58.758 --> 10:00.620
I'm all wetty!
我都湿透了！

10:00.689 --> 10:04.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:04.172 --> 10:07.034
[both babbling]
[两人都胡言乱语]

10:07.103 --> 10:08.172
- I'm ready.
- 我准备好了。

10:08.241 --> 10:10.241
[gasps]
I'm ready!
[喘气]
我准备好了！

10:10.310 --> 10:12.172
I'm ready!
我准备好了！

10:12.241 --> 10:13.551
High-five!
- Yeah!
高五！
- 是的！

10:13.620 --> 10:15.793
- [babbles, laughs]
- [胡言乱语，大笑]

10:15.862 --> 10:18.241
Patrick, I know you
and the Empty Head Society
帕特里克，我认识你
和空头协会

10:18.310 --> 10:20.689
mean well, but man,
we sure messed up a lot
意思是好的，但是伙计，
我们确实搞砸了很多

10:20.758 --> 10:22.137
of things in town today.
今天城里的事情。

10:22.206 --> 10:24.620
So I'm gonna reverse
all the damage that we did
所以我要逆转
我们造成的所有伤害

10:24.689 --> 10:26.620
during the Nitwitting!
在闲聊期间！

10:26.689 --> 10:28.413
- Hey, you'd better hurry
- 嘿，你最好快点

10:28.482 --> 10:30.413
because you're getting smaller!
因为你越来越小了！

10:30.482 --> 10:32.034
What a guy.
真是个家伙啊。

10:32.103 --> 10:33.931
Hmm?
唔？

10:34.000 --> 10:35.482
[babbling]
[胡说]

10:35.551 --> 10:38.827
Nothing like a good sit
in a chair.
没有什么比好好坐一坐更好的了
在椅子上。

10:38.896 --> 10:40.034
Ah.
啊。

10:40.103 --> 10:42.000
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

10:42.068 --> 10:43.655
Oh, that's weird.
哦，这很奇怪。

10:43.724 --> 10:45.103
[impish music]
[顽皮的音乐]

10:45.172 --> 10:47.827
Everything's already back
to normal.
一切都已经回来了
至正常。

10:47.896 --> 10:50.310
What?
什么？

10:50.379 --> 10:51.482
Hmm.
唔。

10:51.551 --> 10:54.137
[babbling]
[胡说]

10:54.206 --> 10:55.344
Oh.
哦。

10:55.413 --> 10:57.172
Hmm.
Well, it's still a mess
唔。
好吧，还是一团糟

10:57.241 --> 10:58.620
over here.
在这里。

10:58.689 --> 11:00.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:00.448 --> 11:02.344
[gasps]
Sandy?
[喘气]
桑迪？

11:02.413 --> 11:05.724
You cleaned everything up?
- Of course, SpongeBob.
你把所有东西都清理干净了吗？
- 当然，海绵宝宝。

11:05.793 --> 11:08.172
I belong to a club
called FEHMA.
我属于一个俱乐部
称为FEHMA。

11:08.241 --> 11:11.689
That stands for "Fix
the Empty Head's Mess Again."
这代表“修复
空脑袋又乱了。”

11:11.758 --> 11:13.793
Our civic duty is repairing
the mayhem
我们的公民义务是修复
混乱

11:13.862 --> 11:16.931
that the Empty Heads cause
every month.
空脑袋造成的
每个月。

11:17.000 --> 11:19.827
You got some gunk on your tie.
- Yeah, they're badges.
你的领带上沾了一些东西。
- 是的，它们是徽章。

11:19.896 --> 11:22.103
[munching]
- Hey, SpongeBob.
[咀嚼]
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

11:22.172 --> 11:24.413
How would you like
to join FEHMA?
你想要怎样
加入FEHMA？

11:24.482 --> 11:26.000
- No thanks.
- 不，谢谢。

11:26.068 --> 11:28.275
After giving my brain
a vacation, I need a rest.
献出我的大脑后
放假了，我需要休息。

11:28.344 --> 11:30.448
both: Huh?
- Uh-oh!
两人：啊？
- 呃哦！

11:30.517 --> 11:32.310
Speaking of "brain vacation."
说到“大脑假期”。

11:32.379 --> 11:34.241
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

11:34.310 --> 11:37.103
[all babbling]
[全是胡言乱语]

11:37.172 --> 11:38.379
[horn tooting]
[喇叭声]

11:38.448 --> 11:39.758
all: ♪ We must admit ♪
所有人：♪ 我们必须承认 ♪

11:39.827 --> 11:41.758
♪ We're dumb as a box
of rocks ♪
♪ 我们就像一个盒子一样愚蠢
岩石♪

11:41.827 --> 11:43.448
♪ But time permitting ♪
♪ 但如果时间允许 ♪

11:43.517 --> 11:46.103
♪ We'll be nitwitting ♪
♪ 我们会开玩笑 ♪

11:46.172 --> 11:49.586
- ♪ Has anyone seen my socks? ♪
[grunts]
- ♪ 有人看到我的袜子了吗？ ♪
[咕哝]

11:49.610 --> 11:56.645
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪